## T5 · Key comparisons

::: table | Comparisons examiners like in Topic 5.
@widths 3.4,5.3,5.3
@font 9.5
Aspect | One side | The other side
Rank vs score | Rank: position among countries; depends on others | Score: share of the gap closed (0–100%)
Fundamental rights vs Principles of Policy | Arts 8–28: enforceable in court | Arts 29–40 (incl. 34, 35, 37): goals, not enforceable
Glass ceiling vs sticky floor | Invisible barrier to the top jobs | Trapped in low-wage, low-mobility jobs
Practical vs strategic gender needs | Water, clinics, income within current roles | Land, laws, voice — change power
Talaq vs khula | Husband's divorce; MFLO notice, 90 days | Wife's divorce through court (*Khurshid Bibi* 1967)
Haq mehr vs dowry | Husband's duty to the wife | Bride's family's goods; restricted by the 1976 Act
Hudood 1979 vs 2006 Act | Rape under the Zina Ordinance; risk to complainants | Rape returned to the Penal Code
Three delays | Deciding · reaching | Receiving care (Thaddeus and Maine 1994)
Single-axis vs intersectional policy | "Women" as one group | Designed for overlaps; disaggregated data
:::
